# a3b, with a server-side thinking budget: a structured role that turns thinking on (RoleConfig.thinking) may
# think 1536 tokens, then llama-server closes the think block itself and the grammar takes over in the same call
# (D33). Roles with thinking off are unaffected.
# Qwen3.5-35B-A3B (MoE, 3B active), Unsloth UD-Q4_K_XL: the first local model. 32k a slot.
MODEL=$HOME/llms/text-generation-webui/user_data/models/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf
CTX=98304
CKPT=512
THINK_BUDGET=1536
